{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>משאת</b> Twice in the Masorah: וישא משאת · משאות שוא ומדוחים. As stated in the Midrash: he would strike the goblet and say, 'So-and-so and so-and-so from one mother — sit together, but I have no maternal brother, and Benjamin has no maternal brother — sit together.' And this was משאות שוא ומדוחים."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 43, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:19.908976230Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}